<title>POLAND: PPABANK JULY NET FLAT AT PLN 1.0 MLN.</title>
<headline>PPABANK JULY NET FLAT AT PLN 1.0 MLN.</headline>
<dateline>WARSAW 1997-08-12</dateline>
<text>
<p>Preliminary results July </p>
<p>(in million zlotys unless stated)</p>
<p> JULY						 1997	 1996</p>
<p> Net profit					  1.02 vs    1.03</p>
<p> Pre-tax profit				    1.70 vs    1.62</p>
<p> Profit on banking operations		  5.02 vs    3.89</p>
<p> Interest and other related revenues	 7.27 vs    4.82</p>
<p> JANUARY-JULY					1997	 1996</p>
<p> Net profit					  7.18 vs    4.26</p>
<p> Pre-tax profit				   11.77 vs    7.62</p>
<p> Profit on banking operations		 33.13 vs   22.50</p>
<p> Interest and other related revenues	44.23 vs   28.84</p>
<p>Note. Full name of the Polish bank is Pierwszy Polsko-</p>
<p>Amerykanski Bank SA.</p>
<p>-- Warsaw Newsroom +48 22 653 9700</p>
